  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台灣人寫真 - 漂白水"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; color: #333;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: #000; font-size: 36px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">漂白水</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0;\">/ 彭雅惠</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjkkZVqkYMpHLi13ttPOlzS1UWegqfC-xHa8OKSYtwrP-zYhRZsND1UjHRvWBwct9A2qpXTYpH3bKr3juXVHvP69YBua867ot6S_a0EdWsEIIPHqquXP4qXQqruD6CnvM2bkh8AGEfogjhNcSzvTDprLfCo39gGHo00ErjbFvO8x8gg3OxE99_VY32Wreus\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: justify; padding: 0 10px;\">\n        Ē記得細漢ê時，阿母tiānn-tiānn tshuā阮去市內五姑婆in兜tshit-thô。阿母總共有七个阿姑，我問伊是按怎lóng來五姑婆in兜--leh？阿母講伊kah五婆khah親，自出社會就蹛tī tsia到嫁hōo阿爸，五姑婆就親像伊ê第二个阿母。<br><br>五姑婆in兜有一个特別ê氣味——「漂白水」，hit个味m̄知影是按怎一直蹛tī我頭殼內到tsit-má，m̄管tī佗位，鼻著tsit个味我就ē想起五姑婆。<br><br>五姑婆是一个tsiok優雅ê查某人，伊講話khuann-khuann仔，頭毛兩三工就ài去hōo人siat-tooh，永遠lóng保持kah tsiânn整齊。伊mā tsiânn gâu kah衫仔褲，bē親像一般ê老歲仔人穿kah花lok-lok。<br><br>讀國小若是歇熱，我kah小妹lóng ē去五姑婆in兜蹛，hit時tsūn iáu-koh leh讀大學ê兩个阿姨就ē陪阮sńg，教阮畫圖、做功課，到下晡就ē tshuā阮去kám仔店買四秀仔。我iáu ē記得我kah小妹tsiok愛lim『養樂多』配『義美小泡芙』，一直到tsit-má tsit兩項我猶原上kah意，三不五時買來食。<br><br>漂白水ê味就是五姑婆ê氣味，m̄管我tī佗位鼻著hit个味，頭殼內就ē浮起對五姑婆ê思念kah細漢蹛tī in兜ê回憶。雖然五姑婆已經tńg--去--looh，蹛ê所在mā改做餐廳，但是hit个氣味永遠lóng bē放bē記--得！伊就親像一款特別為我調製ê芳水，鼻著伊宛然春風勻勻仔吹--過，涼涼、芳芳koh甜甜，一直tī我ê心肝內。<br>\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid #eeeeee; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgcaJA6N1ZrqgmRUKUpwRw_bfFGnWPXE-oN4zAE4h4X2M64Aed3YCoqI1GA9YW53DORyrqM-REyDAMwEw82xn7QZcPCJs4Lywf0ZbrOVcFMVSHNVJPpN1ttnKE3Dmr-sydbgQFcHB67mwVOPp_mioP1mq3U0EWv-41HqZyvzNWeXu7LTU1dImdfZD8ZeE-K\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 389期，2026年08月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br>\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br>\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
